{
  "info": {
    "name": "SmartOmni TikTok Simulator - contract samples (unverified)",
    "description": "Samples for operations whose schema comes from the official bundled OAS (status unverified: docv2, scopes and error codes unread). Set variables in a Postman environment; never commit real secrets. The pre-request script signs GET and JSON-body requests (body appended to the string to sign; evidence is indirect: the toolkit's local-broker signer, not the Common Parameters page). Uploads (multipart) are not signable: rule unverified. Fixtures per operation: contracts/fixtures/ops/. Phase 04-09 samples added; request bodies for write operations (inventory update, ship package, return approve, send message) follow the simulator implementation of the official OAS and stay unverified. Voucher creation has no sample on purpose (locked).",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "base_url",
      "value": "http://localhost:8090"
    },
